00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:38.020
Middle of January, 1591 - Owari Province - Kiyosu

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:52.000
Please don't worry about Ōushu. I have taken care of that for you.

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:59.910
Will Masamune come to the capital and bow his head to me?

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:08.380
Your concern about the infighting between Date and Gamō must have also reached the heavens.

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:13.520
I've had Rikyū and Hidenaga take care of the nation's affairs.

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:15.770
But now that'snot possible.

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:20.880
Go ask Ishida Mitsunari first if anything is troubling you.

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:22.750
Ask the Jibunoshō?

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:24.580
Are you dissatisfied with that?

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:30.770
No, it's just that Master Rikyū and the others may not accept it.

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:38.810
The heavens will keep on expanding. I cannot rely only on the power of the aesthetes of imperfection.

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:43.940
I must establish proper order to maintain stability in the world.

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:48.840
You're the Chosen One

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:52.700
I'll have Mitsunari decides what happens with Rikyū.

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:53.030
Kyoto - Daitoku Temple - Main Gate

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:41.200
Hasegawa Tōhaku's ceiling painting and that sculpture...

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:44.070
All singing praises for Rikyū.

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:48.010
All of this is the will of Kokei Sōchin.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:57.320
Many past generals have failed to construct the main gate, but Master Rikyū did it.

00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:00.850
What is wrong with placing the sculpture here?

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:03.670
Do you seriously not know?

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:10.640
The Chief Advisor, the nobility, and even the Emperor himself passes through these gates.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:16.310
Underneath Rikyū's feet!

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:21.090
Move the sculpture immediately!

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:25.700
I am in charge of the heavens after the death of Lord Hidenaga!

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.620
I will enact your punishment swiftly.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:30.680
This is too much!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.770
There's one more thing.

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:41.330
Rikyū knows you've put the sculpture here, right?

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:48.240
He knows, right?

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:56.890
What is this?

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:02.580
It's a cylindrical tea cup from Korea named Hikigi no Saya.

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:05.090
Why did the Master give you this?

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:09.520
I was supposed to meet with him these past few days, but it never happened.

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:11.590
He gave me this to apologize.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:18.300
I wonder if things have calmed down?

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.300
It doesn't look good.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:27.280
Lord Ishida is a stubborn man. He's intent on making Master fall.

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:32.430
We can't speak with the Chief Advisor directly since he is in Kiyosu.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.000
I don't know why we can't see Master lately, either.

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:45.230
In any case, I didn't think Master would have something like this.

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:48.420
That's why I'm here.

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:51.130
This seems like something he got recently,

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:54.140
but doesn't it look quite different from his tastes?

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:59.020
This tea cup also has a crazy nickname, the Garment of Kyōgen Noh Performers.

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:01.740
What is he thinking, giving this to me?

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:06.700
I would have been happier with an Imayaki.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:08.600
Garment of Kyōgen Noh Performers?

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:16.270
Well, this is a pretty nice tea cup, actually.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:20.620
This is probably an antique Mishima.

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:26.200
White powdered glaze was painted on top of the original green color, creating a new tea cup.

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:30.830
It may lack the brilliance of the white porcelain from China and Korea,

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:33.150
but with the lack of bling comes imperfection.

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:37.950
This bumpiness can only be created by a master.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:39.520
There you go again.

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:45.270
You're singing praises just because it looks kind of like your Setoya tea wares.

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.610
He's snickering!

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:56.080
Master probably got that tea bowl after he saw my Imayaki.

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:04.070
Maybe I was the impetus in changing Master's taste in imperfection!?

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:10.470
No, now's not the time to be happy.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:13.690
I must do something about the incident at the Sanmon main gate.

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:25.820
I'm tired from the many falconry sessions. I won't need you today.

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:48.930
Even you are punished, Rikyū.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.220
I was too careless.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:54.980
I should have at least moved the sculpture elsewhere.

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:57.770
Please do not blame yourself.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:01.750
Even without that sculpture, he would have thought up another reason.

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.650
Perhaps Lord Ishida has heard of our plans...

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:06.140
That is impossible.

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:12.360
If he had, then I would have been killed like Sōji.

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:18.360
We must kill Toyotomi quickly.

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.420
Whether by fortune or misfortune,

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:24.870
the death of Lord Hidenaga has shook the very foundation of the Toyotomi clan.

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:27.800
If only the Chief Advisor also...

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:36.630
I already gave Ogin the final signal.

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:41.540
In the present I gave the Chief Advisor...

00:08:42.010 --> 00:08:44.490
Does that mean Ogin will lose her life, too?

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:51.400
Seems like you have made your decision, Father.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:57.080
I am ready for the final word, at any time.

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:02.050
After the Chief Advisor is dead,

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:07.320
we will need to decide who will place the one flower in the heaven's vase.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:09.750
How about Lord Mōri?

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:12.760
He's young and he wields power.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:17.990
He understands us well and has much sway over the daimyo.

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:21.940
Do you have a problem with him?

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:32.540
Lord Mōri's eyes remind me of the Chief Advisor in the past.

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:41.500
If he becomes the one who rules the heavens, history might repeat itself.

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:44.970
But the other people we have...

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:50.320
I will invite Lord Tokugawa for a tea ceremony in a few days.

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:56.620
I will reveal everything to him and entrust him with our future.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:04.610
He has the power, but he lacks the aesthetics!

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:09.800
That's correct. Lord Tokugawa is all about simplicity, not refined tastes.

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:12.850
He will not be a right fit with us.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:18.700
Perhaps that is why we are in this predicament?

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:23.410
If Lord Tokugawa does not agree with our plans, then he will reveal everything.

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:30.130
I will take all responsibility.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:35.330
This is the greatest bet of my life.

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:51.480
It has been quite some time since I have returned to the capital with you.

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:58.840
My heart feels heavy as I arrive, with the thoughts of that man.

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:03.190
I feel the same way, Monk Tenkai.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:12.750
No matter what happens now,

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:17.160
I will never forget Akechi's conviction.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:21.280
January 24, 1591 - Kyoto - Residence of Sen no Rikyū

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:31.020
This is why I hate tea rooms.

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:37.730
Please use this to cool down.

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:53.300
What superb abalone skewer and miso soup.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:59.930
It's hard to find these at Edo, and he presents just the right amount.

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.920
That cold towel, too.

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:07.020
He's making me loosen my guard.

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:11.870
Is this the magic of Kyoto... No, Sen no Rikyū?

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:13.760
I must be careful.

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:29.080
I heard from Imai Sōkun that you are building a wonderful city in Edo.

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:34.190
Perhaps that will become the center of Japan one day.

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:35.930
Not really.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:42.380
Kyoto, Osaka, Nagoya... compared to those cities the Chief Advisor has,

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:43.460
I have a long way to go.

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:45.840
I've heard this from your men.

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:55.610
There is no one else but Lord Tokugawa that can build and maintain a long-lasting peace.

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:00.440
Your words won't change anything.

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:03.430
Those words echo my very thoughts.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:24.190
I would like you to rule the heavens in place of Toyotomi, from the bottom of my heart.

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:40.840
What!? This is...!?

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:46.330
Names of the commanders who bear ill will towards Toyotomi's actions.

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:51.230
Don't think of them as commanders, but as the will of the people.

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:55.460
Their endless cries...

00:13:55.840 --> 00:14:00.260
I believe you can unite them as one.

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:09.620
My daughter Ogin is at the Chief Advisor's side, ready to send him to the other world.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:19.270
All that's left is for you to take the lead.

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:27.760
The sacrifice of one life will bring about great success.

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:39.730
This is too sudden.

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:46.690
I think the commanders' complaints are well-grounded.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:51.700
During Odawara's tea ceremony,

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:54.490
I could already sense their disappointment.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:03.480
But I did not know your true intentions.

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:07.030
That is why I did not taste your tea.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:15.550
I only want to spread true imperfection throughout the world.

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:19.920
I do not believe that is worth throwing away your life for.

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:27.320
No matter how absurd one's ambitions lie, there has to be sacrifices.

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:32.470
There are many in the world that acknowledge imperfection.

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:35.430
The Chief Advisor and I had worked together.

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:42.700
We sacrificed Lord Oda Nobunaga.

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:50.960
You were the one...

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:57.360
Was Lord Akechi in the palm of your hand, too!?

00:15:58.420 --> 00:15:59.340
Correct.

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:08.490
I will never agree to your plot!

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:12.460
You will be crushed by the hammer of justice one day!

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:16.980
I refuse!

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:20.370
The justice that you yearn for...

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:26.430
If not attained, becomes a mere figment of a painting.

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:30.180
What you wish for and what you do are two different things.

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:36.420
If you do not dirty your own hands, you cannot make your ambitions a reality.

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:40.770
Right now...

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:46.560
It is time to stop with the talking and begin the doing.

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:50.790
If you become the one to welcome a new world,

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:56.790
please leave a space for the true aesthetes of imperfection.

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:04.880
If you can achieve that, then I may very well leave my position.

00:17:44.150 --> 00:17:45.420
I cannot answer you now.

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:49.290
Please give me some time.

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:06.280
I, Ieyasu, was with Akechi during his last moments.

00:18:11.410 --> 00:18:14.160
I want you to understand his lingering regrets.

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:17.440
Let me give you an eulogy in the form of a poem.

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:25.370
The lingering moon watches, Akechi's last words with his wife.

00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:33.770
Where's the rest of it? The final two 7-7 lines?

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:35.550
There are none.

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:39.460
He said the last two lines are just extras.

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:58.520
A poem lacking the last two lines!?

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:02.240
I never realized Lord Akechi's sense of aesthetics had evolved that much...

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:11.400
So that means I was an idiot and destroyed the budding of true imperfection...

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:15.960
Just like what the Chief Advisor did to Sōji...

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:19.080
I was the same...

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:26.450
I see.

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:28.630
Date has finally arrived at the capital.

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:33.420
I stopped by Owari on the way here and saw the Chief Advisor at Kiyosu Castle.

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.730
Can you open the window?

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:39.210
You'll catch a cold.

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:40.600
I don't mind.

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:47.650
The moon tonight is full of imperfection.

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:52.820
January 27 - Owari Province - Kiyosu Castle

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:02.050
Raise you head.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:06.850
What's the matter with your face?

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:09.040
I'm really happy!

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:12.010
I thought you'd be feeling down after the death of your younger brother.

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:15.740
You're eating so much so early in the morning! Looking good!

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:19.770
Stop that boonie act now.

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:22.760
Oh well.

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:28.080
I heard about what happened in Ōu from Tokugawa.

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:31.970
Not bad for you to come all the way here to lower your head at me.

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:35.140
But...

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:42.220
Gamō has came here already and told me he has something regarding the incident to show me.

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:45.620
I need to return to Kyoto and have a look.

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:52.110
Enjoy your meal here.

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:56.150
If you are really the cause behind the rebellions,

00:20:56.800 --> 00:21:00.730
then this will be your last meal. Got it?

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:07.340
It didn't go as planned, Katakura!

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:12.000
The Chief Advisor is just itching to punish me!

00:21:12.220 --> 00:21:15.000
That's because you struck out at Gamō!

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:18.640
I should just march straight to Kyoto with these 1,000 men!

00:21:18.850 --> 00:21:21.020
Don't go destoying yourself now.

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:26.760
There's a man from the Maeda clan living in Ōtsu named Takayama.

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:30.470
I'm sure he'll have a good idea of what we should do.

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:34.550
That's right. Just like what happened at Odawara.

00:21:44.360 --> 00:21:46.620
This is gold dust from Michinoku Province.

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:49.190
That's enough for you two, right?

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:53.840
What I ask is...

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:57.750
for you to help out this stranded one-eyed dragon!

00:22:00.390 --> 00:22:03.990
Save my ass! 

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:08.750
If you don't agree to make up with Gamō first,

00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:12.340
then we can do nothing.

00:22:24.210 --> 00:22:27.020
After we reach the capital, I'll go apologize!

00:22:28.060 --> 00:22:30.380
But that will be difficult.

00:22:30.790 --> 00:22:34.310
You've went against the Chief Advisor twice now.

00:22:34.690 --> 00:22:35.710
That's right.

00:22:36.060 --> 00:22:39.230
You got away with it with those white clothes at Odawara.

00:22:39.640 --> 00:22:43.500
I don't think the same trick will work twice.

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:46.970
What should we do, then?

00:22:47.530 --> 00:22:50.000
I have an idea.

00:23:03.780 --> 00:23:06.510
Everytime I　

00:23:03.780 --> 00:23:06.510
Anata no mune

00:23:06.670 --> 00:23:08.900
feel your heart

00:23:06.670 --> 00:23:08.900
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.630 --> 00:23:14.990
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.630 --> 00:23:14.990
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:21.170
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:21.170
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:22.020 --> 00:23:27.330
Opppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:22.020 --> 00:23:27.330
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:33.420
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:33.420
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.420 --> 00:23:37.300
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.420 --> 00:23:37.300
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.530 --> 00:23:40.880
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.530 --> 00:23:40.880
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:46.750
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:46.750
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.850 --> 00:23:49.750
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.850 --> 00:23:49.750
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.830 --> 00:23:52.360
Without each other.

00:23:49.830 --> 00:23:52.360
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:53.320
You should

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:53.320
Soshite

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:58.820
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:58.820
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:02.610
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:02.610
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:08.320
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:08.320
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:14.810
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:14.810
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.870 --> 00:24:20.610
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.870 --> 00:24:20.610
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:22.090 --> 00:24:26.590
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:22.090 --> 00:24:26.590
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:35.170 --> 00:24:36.880
Embrace me!

00:24:40.250 --> 00:24:41.540
Catch it!

00:24:47.970 --> 00:24:49.600
Let me...

00:24:50.440 --> 00:24:52.890
The Man Who Destroyed the World.

00:24:53.710 --> 00:24:54.940
To be a warrior or an aesthete?

00:24:55.680 --> 00:24:58.080
That is the question.

00:24:57.050 --> 00:25:02.050
The Man Who Destroyed the World
